<title>FINLAND: OKOBANK'S OIP TO LAUNCH FIM 100 MLN 5-YR BOND.</title>
<headline>OKOBANK'S OIP TO LAUNCH FIM 100 MLN 5-YR BOND.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>OKO-Investointipankki Oy (OIP), part of cooperative controlled OKOBANK , will issue six-year variable rate bonds with a 5.0 percent coupon for 100 million markka, OKOBANK said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The subscription period runs from December 10 to April 10, 1997, it said.</p>
<p>A bourse listing will be sought for the bond after the subscription period.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
